# Rust stable toolchain. Component sha256 values are xz_hash from
# channel-rust-1.99.1.toml. The updater trusts those hashes only after the
# channel manifest signature matches the Rust release key.
# Archives are rustc, cargo, rust-std, rustfmt, and clippy. There is no rustup.
